: 212, "text": "So here it is, this song ends"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "But the laughter will remain, because it is so contagious"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Remember, music is liberating"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And in absurdity, we find the greatness of life"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}